1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:03,080
Jadi kalau kita ambil keadaan yang

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:06,700
lain, keadaan yang lain, Nabi sebut:

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:11,044
Inna bil Madinati lirijalan ma

4
00:00:11,044 --> 00:00:15,084
sirtum masiran wa la qata'tum

5
00:00:15,221 --> 00:00:18,500
wadiyan illa kanu ma'akum.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,450
Riwayat tersebut sebut, illa

7
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:22,560
syarakukum fil ajr.

8
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,760
Ketika Nabi bermusafir dengan

9
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,730
sahabat nak pergi perang, sampai

10
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:30,110
tengah jalan, Nabi kata, di Madinah

11
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:34,040
sana benar-benar ada orang-orang lelaki.

12
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:38,330
Kamu tidak berjalan satu perjalanan,

13
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:42,080
satu kejauhan, satu jarak, dan kamu

14
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:46,360
tidak merentasi mana-mana lembah,

15
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:50,780
illa kanu ma'akum, mereka bersama kamu.

16
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:53,800
Jadi riwayat, illa syarakukum fil

17
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:57,110
ajr, mereka bersyarikat, berkongsi

18
00:00:57,110 --> 00:00:59,420
dengan kamu pada pahala.

19
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:03,070
Mereka dekat Madinah tak pergi

20
00:01:03,070 --> 00:01:04,000
perang pun.

21
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,700
Kita ni kena berjalan, sampai kita

22
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:09,220
buat perang, naik bukit, turun

23
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:11,680
bukit, masuk lembah, keluar lembah.

24
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:14,770
Tapi dekat Madinah tu, mereka ni

25
00:01:14,770 --> 00:01:16,900
berkongsi pahala dengan kamu.

26
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:19,760
Kata Nabi, habasahumul maradh.

27
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:22,140
Mereka terhalang oleh sebab sakit.

28
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:24,070
Dia nak pergi perang tapi sakit

29
00:01:24,070 --> 00:01:25,250
menghalang dia.

30
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:27,240
Dia tak pergi perang, dia nak pergi.

31
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:28,690
Kalau dia pergi juga, menyusahkan

32
00:01:28,690 --> 00:01:30,560
orang lain, nak jaga dia pula.

33
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:33,440
Dia buta, nak pergi perang juga,

34
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:35,400
tak boleh pergi perang sebab dia buta.

35
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:37,170
Kalau pergi juga, ganggu orang lain

36
00:01:37,170 --> 00:01:38,080
nak jaga dia pula.

37
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:39,590
Itu antaranya juga.

38
00:01:39,590 --> 00:01:41,900
Abdullah Ibnu Ummi Maktum itu nama dia.

39
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:43,680
Nak pergi perang sangat dengan Nabi,

40
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,560
tak boleh lagi, sebab buta.

41
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:48,610
Jadi, kat situ lah ambil faedah.

42
00:01:48,610 --> 00:01:50,360
Orang yang nak pergi buat benda

43
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,650
hak wajib, tapi tak dapat buat,

44
00:01:52,650 --> 00:01:55,210
kerana sebab sakit, pahala berkongsi

45
00:01:55,210 --> 00:01:56,170
pahala.

46
00:01:56,170 --> 00:01:57,100
Satu faedah.
